enemyBossHammerhead,3.6,"The hammerhead boss. The one boss asset whose size lives ENTIRELY in this column: enemyHammerhead has no row at all, so the wave animal spawns at 1 and its fit of 4.0 is its whole on-screen length. 4.0 x 3.6 = 14.4 here, and bossHammerhead's 1.6 takes it to 23.0 - the smallest boss body in the game, which is the point of it. Out of family with the other numbers in this column for exactly that reason; measured by tools/boss-scale-check.mjs"
